@startuml
actor Student
participant "Web Browser" as Browser
participant "Flask Application" as Flask
participant "Question Bank\n(in-memory)" as Bank
participant "Evaluation Module" as Eval
participant "Result List\n(in-memory)" as Results
Student -> Browser: Enter login details
Browser -> Flask: POST /login
Flask --> Browser: Login success / dashboard
Student -> Browser: Start examination
Browser -> Flask: GET /exam
Flask -> Bank: Read questions
Bank --> Flask: Question list
Flask --> Browser: Render examination page
Student -> Browser: Select answers and submit
Browser -> Flask: POST /submit_exam
Flask -> Eval: Compare selected answers
Eval --> Flask: Score and total
Flask -> Results: Store result
Flask --> Browser: Display result
@enduml
